; claude: the base of the from-scratch graphics libraries of graphics/:
; the framebuffer (a grid of pixels in memory), drawing images onto it
; (Blit), and the switch between optimized and simple code (Opti). See
; docs/claude_notes/notes_2d.md.
;
; A private library (no public_name, so no .opam of its own): the
; (package ...) field installs it as an internal part of the package of
; its only public user, elm_playground_software. Like the other
; graphics/ libraries, it depends on nothing of the Playground, only on
; plain numbers: points, colors, pixels.
(library
 (name graphics_core)
 (package elm_playground_software)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries graphics_2d_geometry) ; Affine, for Blit
)
